1
00:09:20,869 --> 00:09:26,869
Welcome to America.

2
00:18:41,739 --> 00:18:47,739
The Brutalist is a drama film directed by Brady Corbet.

3
00:28:02,608 --> 00:28:08,608
When an innovative modern architect flees post-war Europe, he
is given the opportunity to rebuild his legacy.

4
00:37:23,478 --> 00:37:29,478
Set during the dawn of the modern United States (in Pennsylvania), his wife joins him,
and their lives are forever changed by a demanding, wealthy patron.

5
00:46:44,347 --> 00:46:50,347
László Tóth, played by Adrien Brody.

6
00:56:05,217 --> 00:56:11,217
Erzsébet Tóth, played by Felicity Jones.

7
01:05:26,086 --> 01:05:32,086
Harrison Lee Van Buren Sr, played by Guy Pearce.

8
01:14:46,956 --> 01:14:52,956
Harry Lee, played by Joe Alwyn.

9
01:24:07,826 --> 01:24:13,826
Zsófia, played by Raffey Cassidy.

10
01:33:28,695 --> 01:33:34,695
Maggie Lee, played by Stacy Martin.

11
01:42:49,565 --> 01:42:55,565
The Brutalist is a 2024 epic period drama film directed and produced by
Brady Corbet, who co-wrote the screenplay with Mona Fastvold.

12
01:52:10,434 --> 01:52:16,434
It stars Adrien Brody as a Jewish-Hungarian architect and severely traumatized Holocaust survivor who
emigrates to the United States, where he struggles to recover and get his life back on track.

13
02:01:31,304 --> 02:01:37,304
The cast also features Felicity Jones, Guy Pearce, Joe Alwyn, Raffey Cassidy,
Stacy Martin, Emma Laird, Isaach de Bankolé, and Alessandro Nivola.

14
02:10:52,173 --> 02:10:58,173
The film was shot using the VistaVision format which had
been originally developed in the 1950s.

15
02:20:13,043 --> 02:20:19,043
A co-production of the United States, the United Kingdom, and Hungary, The Brutalist premiered at the 81st Venice
International Film Festival on September 1, 2024, where Corbet was awarded the Silver Lion for Best Direction.

16
02:29:33,913 --> 02:29:39,913
It was released in the United States by A24 on December 20, 2024; in Hungary by UIP-DunaFilm on January 23, 2025; and
in the United Kingdom by Focus Features through Universal Pictures International on January 24, 2025.

17
02:38:54,782 --> 02:39:00,782
The film received critical acclaim and grossed $50.4
million against a $9.6 million budget.

18
02:48:15,652 --> 02:48:21,652
Among multiple accolades, the film earned ten nominations at the 97th Academy Awards, including Best
Picture, winning for Best Cinematography, Best Original Score, and Best Actor for Brody.

19
02:57:36,521 --> 02:57:42,521
At the 82nd Golden Globe Awards, it won three awards,
including Best Motion Picture – Drama.

20
03:06:57,391 --> 03:07:03,391
It was named one of the top ten films of 2024 by the American Film Institute.

21
03:16:18,260 --> 03:16:24,260
The film explores themes of new york city, immigrant, prostitute,
husband wife relationship, philadelphia, pennsylvania.

22
03:25:39,130 --> 03:25:45,130
The tone is dark and emotional.
